1
00:00:00,917 --> 00:00:06,140
ARTETA: City won again. They are right behind us! We
are NOT handing Pep first place

2
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:06,837
ARTETA: this year!

3
00:00:07,417 --> 00:00:08,917
[MUSIC: The title chase]

4
00:00:08,042 --> 00:00:12,332
NARRATOR: Arsenal were leading the league.
Unfortunately, they had seen what happens

5
00:00:12,332 --> 00:00:14,282
NARRATOR: when Pep starts following them.

6
00:00:15,083 --> 00:00:17,243
ARTETA: He’s only walking. We’re fine.

7
00:00:19,708 --> 00:00:22,988
ARTETA: We are sprinting! How is he getting closer?

8
00:00:23,792 --> 00:00:26,672
PEP: You always get tired around this part, Mikel.

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,740
COURIER: Your annual second-place delivery! Same shelf
as last time?

10
00:00:32,542 --> 00:00:35,982
ARTETA: Cancel the subscription! We are winning it
this year!

11
00:00:36,792 --> 00:00:37,992
ARTETA: Keep hold of the lead!

12
00:00:40,417 --> 00:00:45,217
REFEREE: He has pulled him down inside the box.
Penalty against Arsenal!

13
00:00:45,792 --> 00:00:47,292
[MUSIC: Telephone hold music]

14
00:00:46,042 --> 00:00:48,842
RECORDED VOICE: For a penalty against Arsenal, please
hold.

15
00:00:50,917 --> 00:00:56,837
OPERATOR: Mikel! Our priority customer. What can we
cancel today?

16
00:00:57,667 --> 00:01:03,341
ARTETA: That penalty against us. Make it disappear.
Same service as the rest of the

17
00:01:03,341 --> 00:01:03,747
ARTETA: season.

18
00:01:04,542 --> 00:01:08,942
OPERATOR: Penalty cancelled. Would you like an Arsenal
corner as a complimentary

19
00:01:08,942 --> 00:01:09,342
OPERATOR: extra?

20
00:01:10,167 --> 00:01:12,327
ARTETA: Now that is customer service.

21
00:01:14,375 --> 00:01:18,775
OPERATOR: Decision: no penalty. Corner to Arsenal.

22
00:01:19,083 --> 00:01:21,483
REFEREE: But Arsenal committed the foul!

23
00:01:21,792 --> 00:01:23,952
OPERATOR: And Arsenal will take the corner.

24
00:01:25,125 --> 00:01:30,186
NARRATOR: One goal would make Arsenal champions. Their
entire season had come down to

25
00:01:30,186 --> 00:01:30,965
NARRATOR: another corner.

26
00:01:31,792 --> 00:01:33,872
GYÖKERES: Do I finally get to shoot?

27
00:01:34,167 --> 00:01:36,007
ARTETA: No. Stand there.

28
00:01:36,667 --> 00:01:38,067
[MUSIC: Two-note mystery motif]

29
00:01:36,833 --> 00:01:41,313
NARRATOR: Come on. There is still time for Arsenal to
bottle this.

30
00:01:42,125 --> 00:01:47,085
GYÖKERES: You signed a striker, Mikel! When do I
actually get to shoot?

31
00:01:52,917 --> 00:01:56,997
GYÖKERES: My first title-winning goal, and I did not
even face the goal?

32
00:01:57,292 --> 00:01:58,732
ARTETA: Exactly as rehearsed.

33
00:01:59,542 --> 00:02:02,502
COURIER: Then where am I taking all these second-place
medals?

34
00:02:02,833 --> 00:02:07,473
ARTETA: Etihad Pharmacy. Ask for Pep. He will need
something for the pain.

35
00:02:08,667 --> 00:02:10,987
ARTETA: Nobody deserves this more than you.

36
00:02:16,333 --> 00:02:17,833
[MUSIC: The familiar two notes]

37
00:02:17,042 --> 00:02:18,242
[MUSIC: The final note]

38
00:02:18,625 --> 00:02:25,076
FERGUSON: I SAID I WAS RETIRED! Now Arsenal have won
the league with a CORNER FLAG and

39
00:02:25,076 --> 00:02:28,705
FERGUSON: a BACKSIDE! STOP GIVING ME REASONS TO COME
BACK!
